 see the game id just use a simple print(game. PlaceId)","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-23T01:54:58.507Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"680861b461a6eae7fa83e516","commentBy":{"_id":"67b3a2cb366f1d59d0969a1c","username":"COMBO_WOCK","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2025-02-17T20:57:47.711Z","lastActive":"2026-01-18T06:13:48.210Z","status":"offline","id":"67b3a2cb366f1d59d0969a1c","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":100},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"@JUANKO_MODS_YT\nYou call it unnecessary because you don’t dev in environments where this tool matters. That’s not a script issue — that’s a you issue. Don’t blame the wrench because you’ve never seen an engine.\n\nLadies and gents, please give a warm welcome to the Clipboard Coder himself — Sir Surface-Level, Lord of print() and Knight of Misunderstanding.👑","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-23T03:42:44.579Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6808623c8335c1f558c94ada","commentBy":{"_id":"67b3a2cb366f1d59d0969a1c","username":"COMBO_WOCK","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2025-02-17T20:57:47.711Z","lastActive":"2026-01-18T06:13:48.210Z","status":"offline","id":"67b3a2cb366f1d59d0969a1c","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":100},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"@JUANKO_MODS_YT\nHERES YOUR NEW NAME:\nClipboard Coder himself — Sir Surface-Level, Lord of print() and Knight of Misunderstanding.👑","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-23T03:45:00.489Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6808634aa89fd911d978a68f","commentBy":{"_id":"6507c8022df0a158d6